===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|delectable}}, from {{der|en|frm|délectable}}, from {{der|en|fro|delectable}}, from {{der|en|ML.|delectare||to delight}}. {{surf|en|delect|-able}}. {{piecewise doublet|en|delightable}}.

